#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:4
msgid "Importing a New Asset"
msgstr "导入新资产"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:8
msgid ""
"NVIDIA Omniverse relies on the Universal Scene Description (USD) file format"
" to import and export assets. USD is an open source file format developed by"
" Pixar Animation Studios. It is a scene description format optimized for "
"large-scale, complex data sets. While this format is widely used in the film"
" and animation industry, it is less common in the robotics community."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA Omniverse 依赖于通用场景描述（USD）文件格式来导入和导出资产。USD "
"是由皮克斯动画工作室开发的开源文件格式。这是一种针对大规模、复杂数据集进行优化的场景描述格式。虽然这种格式在电影和动画行业广泛使用，但在机器人社区中并不常见。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:14
msgid ""
"To this end, NVIDIA has developed various importers that allow you to import"
" assets from other file formats into USD. These importers are available "
"through Omniverse Kit workflows, and the URDF/MJCF Python importers can also"
" be used from a standalone pip wheel:"
msgstr ""
"为此，NVIDIA 开发了多种导入器，将其他文件格式的资产转换为 USD。这些导入器可通过 Omniverse Kit 工作流使用；URDF/MJCF "
"Python 导入器还可通过独立的 pip wheel 使用："

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:19
msgid "**URDF Importer** - Import assets from URDF files."
msgstr "**URDF 导入器** - 从 URDF 文件导入资产。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:20
msgid "**MJCF Importer** - Import assets from MJCF files."
msgstr "**MJCF 导入器** - 从 MJCF 文件导入资产。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:21
msgid ""
"**Mesh Importer** - Import assets from various file formats, including OBJ, "
"FBX, STL, and glTF."
msgstr "**网格导入器** - 从各种文件格式（包括 OBJ、FBX、STL 和 glTF）导入资产。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:24
msgid ""
"The recommended workflow from NVIDIA is to use the above importers to "
"convert the asset into its USD representation. Once the asset is in USD "
"format, you can use the Omniverse Kit to edit the asset and export it to "
"other file formats. Isaac Sim includes these importers by default. They can "
"also be enabled manually in Omniverse Kit."
msgstr ""
"NVIDIA 建议的工作流程是使用上述导入器将资产转换为其 USD 表示形式。一旦资产以 USD 格式存在，您可以使用 Omniverse Kit "
"对资产进行编辑，并将其导出到其他文件格式。Isaac Sim 默认包含这些导入程序。它们也可以在 Omniverse Kit 中手动启用。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:29
msgid ""
"Isaac Lab's URDF and MJCF converter utilities first use the importer APIs "
"from Isaac Sim when the full runtime is installed. In kit-less environments "
"they fall back to the standalone importers described in :ref:`installation-"
"standalone-importers` below. The Kit visualizer and GUI import dialogs still"
" require an Omniverse Kit runtime."
msgstr ""
"安装完整运行时后，Isaac Lab 的 URDF 和 MJCF 转换工具会优先使用 Isaac Sim 的导入器 API。在不依赖 Kit "
"的环境中，则回退到下文 :ref:`installation-standalone-importers` 所述的独立导入器。Kit "
"可视化器和图形界面的导入对话框仍需要 Omniverse Kit 运行时。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:36
msgid ""
"An important note to use assets for large-scale simulation is to ensure that"
" they are in `instanceable`_ format. This allows the asset to be efficiently"
" loaded into memory and used multiple times in a scene. Otherwise, the asset"
" will be loaded into memory multiple times, which can cause performance "
"issues. For more details on instanceable assets, please check the Isaac Sim "
"`documentation`_."
msgstr ""
"用于大规模仿真中使用资产的重要注意事项是确保它们是 `实例化`_ "
"格式。这允许资产有效地加载到内存中，并在场景中多次使用。否则，资产将多次加载到内存中，可能导致性能问题。有关实例化资产的更多详细信息，请查看 Isaac"
" Sim `文档`_ 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:46
msgid "Standalone URDF/MJCF importers"
msgstr "独立 URDF/MJCF 导入器"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:48
msgid ""
"The URDF and MJCF converter scripts run without Isaac Sim. The standalone "
"importers are optional; install them with the ``isaaclab[importers]`` "
"command in :ref:`installation-importers-extra` before running these scripts."
" Optionally pass ``--viz newton_gl`` (or ``rerun`` / ``viser``) to preview "
"the converted asset in a kit-less Isaac Lab visualizer:"
msgstr ""
"URDF 和 MJCF 转换脚本无需 Isaac Sim 即可运行。独立导入器是可选组件；运行脚本前，按照 :ref:`installation-"
"importers-extra` 中的 ``isaaclab[importers]`` 命令安装。也可传入 ``--viz newton_gl`` （或"
" ``rerun`` / ``viser`` ），在不依赖 Kit 的 Isaac Lab 可视化器中预览转换后的资产："

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:62
msgid ""
"If Isaac Sim is installed in the same environment, Isaac Lab uses the Isaac "
"Sim importer extensions first. The standalone wheel is used only when the "
"full Isaac Sim runtime is not available."
msgstr ""
"如果同一环境已安装 Isaac Sim，Isaac Lab 会优先使用 Isaac Sim 导入器扩展。只有完整 Isaac Sim "
"运行时不可用时，才使用独立 wheel。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:70
msgid "Multi-backend assets"
msgstr "多后端资产"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:72
msgid ""
"A converted asset can carry shared USD physics and backend-specific "
"attributes. The Isaac Sim 6.2 standalone URDF and MJCF importers produce "
"layered output such as:"
msgstr ""
"转换后的资产可以同时包含通用 USD 物理属性和后端专用属性。Isaac Sim 6.2 的独立 URDF、MJCF 导入器会生成分层输出，例如："

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:82
msgid ""
"Additional physics layers depend on the source asset and importer version. A"
" layer named ``physx.usda`` or ``mujoco.usda`` does not by itself mean that "
"a variant with that name exists. Inspect the interface USD's ``Physics`` "
"variant set before requesting a backend-specific variant."
msgstr ""
"额外的物理层取决于源资产和导入器版本。名为 ``physx.usda`` 或 ``mujoco.usda`` "
"的层，本身并不意味着存在同名变体。请求后端专用变体前，应检查接口 USD 的 ``Physics`` 变体集。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:86
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.AssetConverterBaseCfg.physics_variant` defaults to "
"``physics``. The tested Isaac Sim 6.2 output exposes ``physics`` and "
"``none``; ``none`` omits the physics payload. Isaac Lab selects the "
"requested variant explicitly and raises an error if the asset has a "
"``Physics`` variant set without that variant. Do not assume that ``physx`` "
"or ``mujoco`` is selectable on every converted asset."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.AssetConverterBaseCfg.physics_variant` 默认为 "
"``physics``。已测试的 Isaac Sim 6.2 输出提供 ``physics`` 和 ``none``，其中 ``none`` 不包含物理"
" payload。Isaac Lab 会显式选择所请求的变体；如果资产具有 ``Physics`` "
"变体集，却没有所请求的变体，就会报错。不要假定所有转换后的资产都提供 ``physx`` 或 ``mujoco`` 选项。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:92
msgid ""
"``run_multi_physics_conversion``, enabled by default, asks the importer to "
"convert supported backend-specific physics attributes. This does not "
"guarantee equivalent solver behavior or support for every source feature. "
"Validate masses, inertias, collisions and joint control on the intended "
"physics backend."
msgstr ""
"默认启用的 ``run_multi_physics_conversion`` "
"要求导入器转换受支持的后端专用物理属性。这并不保证求解器行为等价，也不保证所有源格式功能都受支持。应在目标物理后端验证质量、惯量、碰撞和关节控制。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:97
msgid ""
"With ``run_asset_transformer=False``, the tested converters produce flat "
"output without a ``Physics`` variant set. Isaac Lab leaves that output "
"unchanged rather than selecting a variant. For an existing layered asset, "
":attr:`~sim.UsdFileCfg.variants` can override an available selection at "
"spawn time. Use :ref:`asset-config-backends` to choose configuration "
"overrides for the selected backend."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``run_asset_transformer=False`` 时，经测试的转换器会生成不含 ``Physics`` 变体集的扁平输出。Isaac"
" Lab 保持这种输出不变，不选择变体。对于已有分层资产， :attr:`~sim.UsdFileCfg.variants` "
"可在生成时覆盖可用的变体选择。根据 :ref:`asset-config-backends` ，为所选后端选择配置覆盖项。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:104
msgid "Using URDF Importer"
msgstr "使用 URDF 导入器"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:106
msgid ""
"For using the URDF importer in the GUI, please check the documentation at "
"`URDF importer`_. For using the URDF importer from Python scripts, we "
"include a utility tool called ``convert_urdf.py``. This script creates an "
"instance of :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` which is then passed "
"to the :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter` class."
msgstr ""
"要在 GUI 中使用 URDF 导入器，请查阅 `URDF 导入器`_ 的文档。要在 Python 脚本中使用 URDF 导入器，我们提供了一个名为 "
"``convert_urdf.py`` 的实用工具。这个脚本创建了 :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` "
"的一个实例，然后将其传递给 :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter` 类。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:110
msgid ""
"The URDF importer was upgraded to version 3.0 in Isaac Sim 6, replacing the "
"previous C++ binding-based API with a Python pipeline (``urdf-usd-"
"converter``). Assets are now made instanceable by default — "
"``make_instanceable`` is no longer a configuration option. See the "
":doc:`/source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0` for a full list of "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 6 将 URDF 导入器升级到 3.0，以 Python 管线（ ``urdf-usd-converter`` ）取代旧的 C++ "
"绑定 API。现在默认将资产设为可实例化， ``make_instanceable`` 不再是配置选项。完整的不兼容变更见 "
":doc:`/source/migration/migrating_to_isaaclab_3-0` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:115
msgid ""
"The URDF importer has various configuration parameters that can be set to "
"control the behavior of the importer. The default values for the importer's "
"configuration parameters are specified in the "
":class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` class, and they are listed below. "
"We made a few commonly modified settings to be available as command-line "
"arguments when calling the ``convert_urdf.py``, and they are marked with "
"``*`` in the list. For a comprehensive list of the configuration parameters,"
" please check the documentation at `URDF importer`_."
msgstr ""
"URDF 导入器提供多种配置参数以控制导入行为。默认值由 :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` "
"指定，下文列出相关参数。部分常用设置可在调用 ``convert_urdf.py`` 时通过命令行传入，并以 ``*`` 标记。完整参数列表见 "
"`URDF 导入器 <URDF importer_>`_ 文档。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:119
msgid "Articulation and joint structure"
msgstr "关节体与关节结构"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:121
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.fix_base` * - Whether to fix the "
"base of the robot. This depends on whether you have a floating-base or "
"fixed-base robot. The command-line flag is ``--fix_base`` where when set, "
"the importer will fix the base of the robot, otherwise it will default to "
"floating-base."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.fix_base` * — "
"是否固定机器人基座，取决于机器人采用浮动基座还是固定基座。命令行标志为 ``--fix_base`` ；设置后导入器会固定基座，否则默认采用浮动基座。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:124
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.merge_fixed_joints` * - Whether to "
"merge the fixed joints. Usually, this should be set to ``True`` to reduce "
"the asset complexity. The command-line flag is ``--merge_joints`` where when"
" set, the importer will merge the fixed joints, otherwise it will default to"
" not merging the fixed joints."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.merge_fixed_joints` * — "
"是否合并固定关节。通常应设为 ``True`` ，以降低资产复杂度。命令行标志为 ``--merge_joints`` "
"；设置后导入器会合并固定关节，否则默认不合并。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:127
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.joint_drive` - The configuration for"
" the joint drives on the robot."
msgstr ":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.joint_drive` - 机器人关节驱动的配置。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:129
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.drive_type` - The "
"drive type for the joints. This can be either ``\"acceleration\"`` or "
"``\"force\"``. We recommend using ``\"force\"`` for most cases."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.drive_type` - "
"关节的驱动类型。这个值可以是 ``\"acceleration\"`` 或 ``\"force\"`` 。我们推荐在大多数情况下使用 "
"``\"force\"`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:131
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.target_type` - The "
"target type for the joints. This can be either ``\"none\"``, "
"``\"position\"``, or ``\"velocity\"``. We recommend using ``\"position\"`` "
"for most cases. Setting this to ``\"none\"`` will disable the drive and set "
"the joint gains to 0.0."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.target_type` - "
"关节的目标类型。可以是 ``\"none\"`` 、 ``\"position\"`` 或 ``\"velocity\"`` "
"。我们建议在大多数情况下使用 ``\"position\"`` 。将其设置为 ``\"none\"`` 将禁用驱动并将关节增益设置为 0.0。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:134
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.gains` - The drive "
"stiffness and damping gains for the joint. We support two ways to set the "
"gains:"
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.gains` - "
"关节的驱动刚度和阻尼增益。我们支持两种设置增益的方式:"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:137
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` - To "
"directly set the stiffness and damping. Both ``stiffness`` and ``damping`` "
"accept a single float (applied uniformly)."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.PDGainsCfg` — "
"直接设置刚度和阻尼。 ``stiffness`` 与 ``damping`` 均接受单个浮点数，并统一应用。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:139
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`"
" - To set the gains using the desired natural frequency response of the "
"system. **Deprecated in URDF importer 3.0** — use ``PDGainsCfg`` instead."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.JointDriveCfg.NaturalFrequencyGainsCfg`"
" — 根据系统期望的固有频率响应设置增益。 **在 URDF 导入器 3.0 中已弃用** ，请改用 ``PDGainsCfg`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:144
#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:312
msgid "Geometry, collisions, and materials"
msgstr "几何、碰撞与材料"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:146
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.collision_from_visuals` - Whether to"
" create collision geometry from visual geometry when no explicit "
"``<collision>`` is defined for a link. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.collision_from_visuals` — 当连杆未显式定义 "
"``<collision>`` 时，是否从可视几何创建碰撞几何。默认值为 ``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:148
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.collision_type` - The collision "
"shape simplification to apply. One of ``\"Convex Hull\"`` (default), "
"``\"Convex Decomposition\"``, ``\"Bounding Sphere\"``, or ``\"Bounding "
"Cube\"``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.collision_type` — 碰撞形状的简化方式。可选 "
"``\"Convex Hull\"`` （默认，凸包）、 ``\"Convex Decomposition\"`` （凸分解）、 "
"``\"Bounding Sphere\"`` （包围球）或 ``\"Bounding Cube\"`` （包围立方体）。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:150
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.self_collision` - Whether to "
"activate self-collisions between links of the articulation. Defaults to "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.self_collision` — "
"是否启用关节体各连杆间的自碰撞。默认值为 ``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:152
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.merge_mesh` - Whether to merge "
"meshes where possible to optimize the model. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.merge_mesh` — 是否尽可能合并网格，以优化模型。默认值为 "
"``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:154
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.link_density` - Default density in "
"``kg/m^3`` for links whose ``<inertial>`` properties are missing. ``0.0`` "
"(default) leaves densities unchanged."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.link_density` — 缺少 ``<inertial>`` "
"属性的连杆所用默认密度，单位为 ``kg/m^3`` 。 ``0.0`` （默认值）表示保持密度不变。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:158
#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:352
msgid "Asset resolution and output"
msgstr "资产路径解析与输出"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:160
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.ros_package_paths` - List of ROS "
"package name/path mappings used to resolve ``package://`` URLs in the URDF. "
"Each entry is a dict with keys ``name`` and ``path``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.ros_package_paths` — ROS "
"包名称与路径的映射列表，用于解析 URDF 中的 ``package://`` URL。每项是包含 ``name`` 和 ``path`` 键的字典。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:162
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.robot_type` - Robot type applied by "
"the USD robot schema. Defaults to ``\"Default\"``. Must be one of: "
"``\"Default\"``, ``\"End Effector\"``, ``\"Manipulator\"``, "
"``\"Humanoid\"``, ``\"Wheeled\"``, ``\"Holonomic\"``, ``\"Quadruped\"``, "
"``\"Mobile Manipulators\"``, ``\"Aerial\"``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.robot_type` — USD 机器人模式应用的机器人类型。默认值为"
" ``\"Default\"`` 。可选值为 ``\"Default\"`` 、 ``\"End Effector\"`` 、 "
"``\"Manipulator\"`` 、 ``\"Humanoid\"`` 、 ``\"Wheeled\"`` 、 ``\"Holonomic\"``"
" 、 ``\"Quadruped\"`` 、 ``\"Mobile Manipulators\"`` 或 ``\"Aerial\"`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:165
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.run_asset_transformer` - Run the "
"asset transformer to convert the flattened USD into a layered USD (interface"
" USD + payloads). Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.run_asset_transformer` — "
"运行资产转换处理，将扁平 USD 转换为分层 USD（接口 USD 与载荷）。默认值为 ``True`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:167
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.run_multi_physics_conversion` - Also"
" emit MuJoCo-compatible joint attributes alongside the PhysX ones, so the "
"asset carries both backends. Defaults to ``True``. See :ref:`import-new-"
"asset-multi-backend`."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.run_multi_physics_conversion` — 除 "
"PhysX 属性外，同时输出兼容 MuJoCo 的关节属性，使资产支持两个后端。默认值为 ``True`` 。参见 :ref:`import-new-"
"asset-multi-backend` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:170
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.debug_mode` - Write intermediate "
"conversion artifacts next to the output USD for inspection. Defaults to "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.debug_mode` — 在输出 USD "
"旁写入中间转换产物，便于检查。默认值为 ``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:174
msgid "Deprecated (no-op in URDF importer 3.0)"
msgstr "已弃用（在 URDF 导入器 3.0 中不生效）"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:176
msgid ""
"The following options are retained for backwards compatibility but are "
"ignored by the URDF importer 3.0. A warning is logged when they are set."
msgstr "以下选项为向后兼容而保留，但 URDF 导入器 3.0 会忽略它们。设置时会记录警告。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:179
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.root_link_name` - The link on which "
"the PhysX articulation root was previously placed."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.root_link_name` — 以前用于放置 PhysX "
"关节体根的连杆。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:181
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.convert_mimic_joints_to_normal_joints`"
" - Convert mimic joints to normal joints during conversion."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.convert_mimic_joints_to_normal_joints`"
" — 转换时将 mimic 关节转换为普通关节。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:183
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.replace_cylinders_with_capsules` - "
"Replace cylinder shapes with capsule shapes during conversion."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg.replace_cylinders_with_capsules` — "
"转换时用胶囊形状替换圆柱形状。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:186
msgid ""
"For more detailed information on the configuration parameters, please check "
"the documentation for :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg`."
msgstr "有关配置参数的详细信息，请查阅 :class:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverterCfg` 文档。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:189
#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:370
#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:490
msgid "Example Usage"
msgstr "示例用法"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:191
msgid ""
"In this example, we use the pre-processed URDF file of the ANYmal-D robot. "
"To check the pre-process URDF, please check the file the `anymal.urdf`_. The"
" main difference between the pre-processed URDF and the original URDF are:"
msgstr ""
"在此示例中，我们使用了 ANYmal-D 机器人的经过处理的 URDF 文件。要检查经过处理的 URDF，请查看文件 `anymal.urdf`_ "
"。经过处理的 URDF 与原始 URDF 之间的主要区别在于: "

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:195
msgid ""
"We removed the ``<gazebo>`` tag from the URDF. This tag is not supported by "
"the URDF importer."
msgstr "我们从 URDF 中移除了 ``<gazebo>`` 标记。此标记不受 URDF 导入器支持。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:196
msgid ""
"We removed the ``<transmission>`` tag from the URDF. This tag is not "
"supported by the URDF importer."
msgstr "我们从 URDF 中移除了 ``<transmission>`` 标记。此标记不受 URDF 导入器支持。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:197
msgid ""
"We removed various collision bodies from the URDF to reduce the complexity "
"of the asset."
msgstr "我们从 URDF 中移除了各种碰撞体，以减少资产的复杂性。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:198
msgid ""
"We changed all the joint's damping and friction parameters to ``0.0``. On "
"PhysX this ensures that we can perform effort-control on the joints without "
"the imported drive adding damping of its own. On Newton the actuator "
"configuration decides the target mode instead --- see :ref:`import-new-"
"asset-ensure-drives-exist`."
msgstr ""
"我们将所有关节的阻尼与摩擦参数设为 ``0.0`` 。在 PhysX 中，这可避免导入的驱动自身添加阻尼，使我们能够对关节进行驱动力控制。Newton "
"则由执行器配置决定目标模式，参见 :ref:`import-new-asset-ensure-drives-exist` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:202
msgid ""
"The ``<dont_collapse>`` URDF tag is **no longer supported** in URDF importer"
" 3.0. Fixed joint merging is now a Python pre-processing step that merges "
"all fixed joints when ``merge_fixed_joints`` is enabled. If you need to "
"preserve a specific fixed joint, disable ``merge_fixed_joints`` entirely or "
"restructure the URDF to use a non-fixed joint type (e.g. revolute with zero-"
"range limits)."
msgstr ""
"URDF 导入器 3.0 **不再支持** ``<dont_collapse>`` 标签。固定关节合并现在是 Python 预处理步骤；启用 "
"``merge_fixed_joints`` 后，会合并所有固定关节。如果需要保留某个固定关节，应完全禁用 ``merge_fixed_joints``"
" ，或修改 URDF，使用非固定关节类型，例如限位范围为零的旋转关节。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:208
msgid ""
"Map the ROS package directory with ``--ros_package_path NAME PATH`` so the "
"importer can resolve the robot's ``package://`` mesh references, including "
"when fixed joints are merged."
msgstr ""
"通过 ``--ros_package_path NAME PATH`` 映射 ROS 包目录，使导入器能够解析机器人的 ``package://`` "
"网格引用，包括合并固定关节时的引用。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:211
#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:374
msgid ""
"The following shows the steps to clone the repository and run the converter:"
msgstr "以下显示了克隆存储库并运行转换器的步骤: "

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-linux` Linux"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:0
msgid ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"
msgstr ":icon:`fa-brands fa-windows` Windows"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:259
msgid ""
"Executing the above script will create a USD file inside the "
"``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Robots/ANYbotics/anymal/`` directory (the "
"subdirectory name is derived automatically from the robot name in the URDF):"
msgstr ""
"执行上述脚本，会在 ``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Robots/ANYbotics/anymal/`` 目录中创建 USD"
" 文件（子目录名称由 URDF 中的机器人名称自动生成）："

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:263
msgid "``anymal.usda`` - This is the main asset file."
msgstr "``anymal.usda`` — 主资产文件。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:266
msgid ""
"The URDF importer auto-deduplicates the per-robot subdirectory when it "
"already exists. If you re-run the converter against the same ``usd_dir`` "
"with a changed configuration (for example, flipping ``fix_base``), the "
"importer writes to a new numbered folder (``anymal_1/``, ``anymal_2/``, …) "
"rather than overwriting the previous output. "
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter.usd_path` reflects whichever folder the"
" importer actually used. Delete stale subdirectories manually (or wipe "
"``usd_dir``) if you do not want them to accumulate on disk."
msgstr ""
"如果机器人专用子目录已存在，URDF 导入器会自动避免重名。如果改变配置后（例如切换 ``fix_base`` ）对同一 ``usd_dir`` "
"再次运行转换器，导入器会写入新的编号目录（ ``anymal_1/`` 、 ``anymal_2/`` 等），而不是覆盖原输出。 "
":attr:`~sim.converters.UrdfConverter.usd_path` "
"指向导入器实际使用的目录。如果不希望旧目录在磁盘上累积，可手动删除，或清空 ``usd_dir`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:276
msgid ""
"The examples pass ``--viz kit`` to open the converted asset in the Isaac Sim"
" viewport, which requires a full Isaac Sim installation. Use ``--viz "
"newton_gl``, ``--viz rerun``, or ``--viz viser`` for a kit-less preview "
"instead. Omit ``--viz`` to exit as soon as the conversion completes."
msgstr ""
"示例传入 ``--viz kit`` ，以在 Isaac Sim 视口中打开转换后的资产，这需要完整安装 Isaac Sim。要进行不依赖 Kit "
"的预览，可改用 ``--viz newton_gl`` 、 ``--viz rerun`` 或 ``--viz viser`` 。省略 "
"``--viz`` 时，转换完成后立即退出。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:280
msgid ""
"Inspect the converted geometry and articulation in the viewer, then validate"
" dynamics in the intended simulation backend. Check self-collisions, masses,"
" inertias, and actuator gains if the asset is unstable."
msgstr "先在查看器中检查转换后的几何与关节体，再在目标仿真后端验证动力学。如果资产不稳定，检查自碰撞、质量、惯量和执行器增益。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:285
msgid "result of convert_urdf.py"
msgstr "convert_urdf.py 的结果"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:293
msgid "Using MJCF Importer"
msgstr "使用 MJCF 导入器"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:295
msgid ""
"Similar to the URDF Importer, the MJCF Importer also has a GUI interface. "
"Please check the documentation at `MJCF importer`_ for more details. For "
"using the MJCF importer from Python scripts, we include a utility tool "
"called ``convert_mjcf.py``. This script creates an instance of "
":class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` which is then passed to the "
":class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverter` class."
msgstr ""
"与 URDF 导入器类似，MJCF 导入器也有一个 GUI 界面。请查看 `MJCF导入器`_ 中的文档获取更多详细信息。要在 Python 脚本中使用"
" MJCF 导入器，我们提供了一个名为 ``convert_mjcf.py`` 的实用工具。该脚本创建了一个 "
":class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` 的实例，然后将其传递给 "
":class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverter` 类。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:300
msgid ""
"The default values for the importer's configuration parameters are specified"
" in the :class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` class. The configuration "
"parameters are listed below. We made a few commonly modified settings to be "
"available as command-line arguments when calling the ``convert_mjcf.py``, "
"and they are marked with ``*`` in the list. For a comprehensive list of the "
"configuration parameters, please check the documentation at `MJCF "
"importer`_."
msgstr ""
"导入器配置参数的默认值由 :class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` "
"指定，下文列出相关参数。部分常用设置可在调用 ``convert_mjcf.py`` 时通过命令行传入，并以 ``*`` 标记。完整参数列表见 "
"`MJCF 导入器 <MJCF importer_>`_ 文档。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:307
msgid ""
"The MJCF importer was rewritten in Isaac Sim 5.0 to use the ``mujoco-usd-"
"converter`` library. Settings such as ``import_sites``, "
"``import_inertia_tensor``, and ``make_instanceable`` are no longer needed — "
"the converter now handles these automatically based on the MJCF file "
"content."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim 5.0 重写了 MJCF 导入器，改用 ``mujoco-usd-converter`` 库。 ``import_sites`` 、"
" ``import_inertia_tensor`` 和 ``make_instanceable`` 等设置已不再需要，转换器会根据 MJCF "
"文件内容自动处理。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:314
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.merge_mesh` * - Whether to merge "
"meshes where possible to optimize the model. The command-line flag is "
"``--merge_mesh``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.merge_mesh` * — "
"是否尽可能合并网格，以优化模型。命令行标志为 ``--merge_mesh`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:316
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.collision_from_visuals` * - Whether "
"to generate collision geometry from visual geometries. The command-line flag"
" is ``--collision_from_visuals``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.collision_from_visuals` * — "
"是否从可视几何生成碰撞几何。命令行标志为 ``--collision_from_visuals`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:318
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.collision_type` * - The collision "
"shape simplification to apply. One of ``\"Convex Hull\"`` (default), "
"``\"Convex Decomposition\"``, ``\"Bounding Sphere\"``, or ``\"Bounding "
"Cube\"``. The command-line flag is ``--collision_type``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.collision_type` * — 碰撞形状的简化方式。可选 "
"``\"Convex Hull\"`` （默认，凸包）、 ``\"Convex Decomposition\"`` （凸分解）、 "
"``\"Bounding Sphere\"`` （包围球）或 ``\"Bounding Cube\"`` （包围立方体）。命令行标志为 "
"``--collision_type`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:321
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.self_collision` * - Whether to "
"activate self-collisions between links of the articulation. The command-line"
" flag is ``--self_collision``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.self_collision` * — "
"是否启用关节体各连杆间的自碰撞。命令行标志为 ``--self_collision`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:325
msgid "Articulation and physics"
msgstr "关节体与物理"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:327
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.fix_base` - Whether to add a fixed "
"joint between the world and the root rigid-body link. Defaults to ``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.fix_base` — 是否在世界与根刚体连杆之间添加固定关节。默认值为"
" ``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:329
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.link_density` - Default density in "
"``kg/m^3`` for links whose ``<inertial>`` properties are missing in the "
"MJCF. ``0.0`` (default) leaves densities unchanged."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.link_density` — MJCF 中缺少 "
"``<inertial>`` 属性的连杆所用默认密度，单位为 ``kg/m^3`` 。 ``0.0`` （默认值）表示保持密度不变。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:331
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.import_physics_scene` * - Import "
"physics scene properties (gravity, time step, etc.) from the MJCF file. "
"Defaults to ``False``. The command-line flag is ``--import_physics_scene``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.import_physics_scene` * — 从 MJCF "
"文件导入重力、时间步长等物理场景属性。默认值为 ``False`` 。命令行标志为 ``--import_physics_scene`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:336
msgid "Actuator overrides"
msgstr "执行器覆盖配置"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:338
msgid ""
"MuJoCo models actuators as an affine transformation ``tau = gain @ control +"
" bias``. The following options override the values parsed from the MJCF on a"
" per-actuator basis. Each defaults to ``None``, which leaves the parsed "
"values unchanged."
msgstr ""
"MuJoCo 将执行器建模为仿射变换 ``tau = gain @ control + bias`` 。以下选项按执行器覆盖从 MJCF "
"解析的值，均默认为 ``None`` ，表示保留解析值。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:342
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_gain_type` - The actuator "
"gain type override (e.g. ``\"fixed\"``)."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_gain_type` — 覆盖执行器增益类型，例如 "
"``\"fixed\"`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:344
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_bias_type` - The actuator "
"bias type override (e.g. ``\"affine\"``)."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_bias_type` — 覆盖执行器偏置类型，例如 "
"``\"affine\"`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:346
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_gain_prm` - The actuator "
"gain parameter array override. Example for position control: ``[kp, 0, 0, 0,"
" 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_gain_prm` — "
"覆盖执行器增益参数数组。位置控制示例： ``[kp, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:348
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_bias_prm` - The actuator "
"bias parameter array override. Example for position control: ``[0, -kp, -kd,"
" 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.override_bias_prm` — "
"覆盖执行器偏置参数数组。位置控制示例： ``[0, -kp, -kd, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0]`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:354
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.robot_type` - Robot type applied by "
"the USD robot schema. Defaults to ``\"Default\"``. Must be one of: "
"``\"Default\"``, ``\"End Effector\"``, ``\"Manipulator\"``, "
"``\"Humanoid\"``, ``\"Wheeled\"``, ``\"Holonomic\"``, ``\"Quadruped\"``, "
"``\"Mobile Manipulators\"``, ``\"Aerial\"``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.robot_type` — USD 机器人模式应用的机器人类型。默认值为"
" ``\"Default\"`` 。可选值为 ``\"Default\"`` 、 ``\"End Effector\"`` 、 "
"``\"Manipulator\"`` 、 ``\"Humanoid\"`` 、 ``\"Wheeled\"`` 、 ``\"Holonomic\"``"
" 、 ``\"Quadruped\"`` 、 ``\"Mobile Manipulators\"`` 或 ``\"Aerial\"`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:357
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.run_asset_transformer` - Run the "
"asset transformer to convert the flattened USD into a layered USD (interface"
" USD + payloads). Defaults to ``True``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.run_asset_transformer` — "
"运行资产转换处理，将扁平 USD 转换为分层 USD（接口 USD 与载荷）。默认值为 ``True`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:359
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.run_multi_physics_conversion` - "
"Convert compatible MuJoCo attributes to PhysX attributes (e.g. actuator "
"gains), so the asset carries both backends. Note this is the opposite "
"direction to the URDF importer. Defaults to ``True``. See :ref:`import-new-"
"asset-multi-backend`."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.run_multi_physics_conversion` — 将兼容的"
" MuJoCo 属性（如执行器增益）转换为 PhysX 属性，使资产支持两个后端。注意，转换方向与 URDF 导入器相反。默认值为 ``True`` "
"。参见 :ref:`import-new-asset-multi-backend` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:363
msgid ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.debug_mode` - Write intermediate "
"conversion artifacts next to the output USD for inspection. Defaults to "
"``False``."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg.debug_mode` — 在输出 USD "
"旁写入中间转换产物，便于检查。默认值为 ``False`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:366
msgid ""
"For more detailed information on the configuration parameters, please check "
"the documentation for :class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg`."
msgstr "配置参数的详细信息见 :class:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverterCfg` 文档。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:372
msgid ""
"In this example, we use the MuJoCo model of the Unitree's H1 humanoid robot "
"in the `mujoco_menagerie`_."
msgstr "在这个例子中，我们使用 Unitree 的 H1 人形机器人在 `mujoco_menagerie`_ 中的 MuJoCo 模型。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:414
msgid ""
"Executing the above script will create the USD file inside the "
"``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Robots/Unitree/`` directory:"
msgstr ""
"执行上述脚本，会在 ``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Robots/Unitree/`` 目录中创建 USD 文件："

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:417
msgid "``h1.usd`` - This is the converted USD asset file."
msgstr "``h1.usd`` — 转换后的 USD 资产文件。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:420
msgid ""
"The MJCF importer auto-deduplicates the per-robot subdirectory when it "
"already exists, matching the URDF importer's behavior. If you re-run the "
"converter against the same ``usd_dir`` with a changed configuration, the "
"importer writes to a new numbered folder (``h1_1/``, ``h1_2/``, …) rather "
"than overwriting the previous output. "
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverter.usd_path` reflects whichever folder the"
" importer actually used. Delete stale subdirectories manually (or wipe "
"``usd_dir``) if you do not want them to accumulate on disk."
msgstr ""
"如果机器人专用子目录已存在，MJCF 导入器会自动避免重名，与 URDF 导入器行为一致。如果改变配置后对同一 ``usd_dir`` "
"再次运行转换器，导入器会写入新的编号目录（ ``h1_1/`` 、 ``h1_2/`` 等），而不是覆盖原输出。 "
":attr:`~sim.converters.MjcfConverter.usd_path` "
"指向导入器实际使用的目录。如果不希望旧目录在磁盘上累积，可手动删除，或清空 ``usd_dir`` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:428
msgid ""
"See :ref:`Previewing converted assets <import-new-asset-preview>` for the "
"``--viz`` options."
msgstr "``--viz`` 选项见 :ref:`预览转换后的资产 <import-new-asset-preview>` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:430
msgid "result of convert_mjcf.py"
msgstr "convert_mjcf.py 的结果"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:440
msgid "Joint drives on each physics backend"
msgstr "各物理后端的关节驱动"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:442
msgid ""
"The URDF and MJCF importers write joint drives into the USD. How those "
"drives are then interpreted depends on the physics backend, and on whether "
"an Isaac Lab actuator configuration takes over. (Mesh assets have no joints,"
" so none of this applies to them.)"
msgstr ""
"URDF 和 MJCF 导入器会将关节驱动写入 USD。后续如何解释这些驱动，取决于物理后端，以及是否由 Isaac Lab "
"执行器配置接管。（网格资产没有关节，因此不涉及这些设置。）"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:446
msgid ""
"**PhysX** starts from the imported USD drive properties. Isaac Lab's "
"actuator configuration can override the gains and limits before simulation. "
"The ANYmal example above passes ``--joint_stiffness 0.0 --joint_damping 0.0 "
"--joint_target_type none`` so the imported drive does not add PD effort when"
" the asset is used for effort control."
msgstr ""
"**PhysX** 以导入的 USD 驱动属性为起点。Isaac Lab 执行器配置可在仿真前覆盖增益与限制。上述 ANYmal 示例传入 "
"``--joint_stiffness 0.0 --joint_damping 0.0 --joint_target_type none`` "
"，使资产用于驱动力控制时，导入的驱动不会额外施加 PD 驱动力。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:451
msgid ""
"**Newton** resolves the target mode from the Isaac Lab actuator "
"configuration instead of from the USD alone. When an articulation uses an "
"Isaac Lab actuator configuration, Newton resolves each configured joint's "
"target mode before constructing the solver. For an "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg`, stiffness-only, damping-"
"only, both-gain, and zero-gain configurations select position, velocity, "
"combined position/velocity, and effort modes respectively. A gain set to "
"``None`` keeps the corresponding imported USD value. An explicit actuator "
"configuration uses effort mode because Isaac Lab computes its effort "
"directly."
msgstr ""
"**Newton** 根据 Isaac Lab 执行器配置解析目标模式，而不是只依赖 USD。当关节体使用 Isaac Lab "
"执行器配置时，Newton 会在构建求解器前解析每个已配置关节的目标模式。对于 "
":class:`~isaaclab.actuators.ImplicitActuatorCfg` "
"，仅有刚度、仅有阻尼、两项增益都有，以及零增益配置，分别选择位置、速度、位置与速度组合，以及驱动力模式。增益为 ``None`` 时，保留对应的导入 "
"USD 值。显式执行器配置使用驱动力模式，因为 Isaac Lab 会直接计算其驱动力。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:460
msgid ""
"Joints without an Isaac Lab actuator configuration retain their imported USD"
" settings. Consequently, an asset with zero-gain USD drives no longer needs "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDrivePropertiesCfg.ensure_drives_exist` "
"solely to make configured joints actuate in Newton."
msgstr ""
"未配置 Isaac Lab 执行器的关节保留导入的 USD 设置。因此，对于具有零增益 USD 驱动的资产，不再需要仅为让已配置关节在 Newton "
"中受到驱动而设置 "
":attr:`~isaaclab.sim.schemas.JointDrivePropertiesCfg.ensure_drives_exist` 。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:465
msgid ""
"The ``ensure_drives_exist`` option remains useful when a workflow needs to "
"author placeholder drives independently of an Isaac Lab actuator "
"configuration. When enabled, it assigns a minimal placeholder stiffness "
"(``1e-3``) to zero-gain drives before simulation startup so that every drive"
" exists in the imported model."
msgstr ""
"如果工作流需要独立于 Isaac Lab 执行器配置写入占位驱动， ``ensure_drives_exist`` "
"仍然有用。启用后，它会在仿真启动前，为零增益驱动赋予极小的占位刚度（ ``1e-3`` ），确保导入模型中存在每个驱动。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:472
msgid "Using Mesh Importer"
msgstr "使用网格导入器"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:474
msgid ""
"Omniverse Kit includes the mesh converter tool that uses the ASSIMP library "
"to import assets from various mesh formats (e.g. OBJ, FBX, STL, glTF, etc.)."
" The asset converter tool is available as an extension to Omniverse Kit. "
"Please check the `asset converter`_ documentation for more details. However,"
" unlike Isaac Sim's URDF and MJCF importers, the asset converter tool does "
"not support creating instanceable assets. This means that the asset will be "
"loaded into memory multiple times if it is used multiple times in a scene."
msgstr ""
"Omniverse Kit 包括使用 ASSIMP 库导入各种网格格式的资产的网格转换器工具（例如 OBJ、FBX、STL、glTF "
"等）。资产转换器工具作为 Omniverse Kit 的扩展提供。请查看 `资产转换器`_ 文档了解更多详细信息。然而，与 Isaac Sim 的 "
"URDF 和 MJCF 导入器不同，资产转换器工具不支持创建实例化资产。这意味着如果在场景中多次使用资产，则资产将多次加载到内存中。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:481
msgid ""
"Thus, we include a utility tool called ``convert_mesh.py`` that uses the "
"asset converter tool to import the asset and then converts it into an "
"instanceable asset. Internally, this script creates an instance of "
":class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverterCfg` which is then passed to the "
":class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverter` class. Since the mesh file does not "
"contain any physics information, the configuration class accepts different "
"physics properties (such as mass, collision shape, etc.) as input. Please "
"check the documentation for :class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverterCfg` for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"因此，我们包含一个名为 ``convert_mesh.py`` "
"的实用工具，它使用资产转换器工具导入资产，然后将其转换为实例化资产。在内部，此脚本创建了一个 "
":class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverterCfg` 的实例，然后将其传递给 "
":class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverter` "
"类。由于网格文件不包含任何物理信息，配置类接受不同的物理属性（如质量、碰撞形状等）作为输入。请查看 "
":class:`~sim.converters.MeshConverterCfg` 的文档了解更多详细信息。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:492
msgid ""
"We use an OBJ file of a cube to demonstrate the usage of the mesh converter."
" The following shows the steps to clone the repository and run the "
"converter:"
msgstr "我们使用一个立方体的 OBJ 文件来演示网格转换器的用法。以下显示了克隆存储库并运行转换器的步骤: "

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:536
msgid ""
"The mesh converter requires Isaac Sim. The command writes the converted USD "
"and its instanceable mesh payload under "
"``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Props/CubeMultiColor/`` and opens the Isaac "
"Sim viewport. Select the asset and press ``F`` to frame it in the viewport. "
"Omit ``--viz kit`` to convert without opening a preview."
msgstr ""
"网格转换器需要 Isaac Sim。该命令将转换后的 USD 及其可实例化网格载荷写入 "
"``source/isaaclab_assets/data/Props/CubeMultiColor/`` ，并打开 Isaac Sim "
"视口。选择资产后按 ``F`` ，可使视口对准它。省略 ``--viz kit`` 可在不打开预览的情况下转换。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:541
msgid ""
"If you do not set the ``--mass`` flag, then no rigid body properties will be"
" added to the asset. It will be imported as a static asset."
msgstr "如果您不设置 ``--mass`` 标志，则不会向资产添加刚体属性。它将作为静态资产导入。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:543
msgid ""
"Set ``--collision-approximation none`` to omit collider properties. The "
"default is ``convexDecomposition``, so omitting this flag still creates "
"collision geometry."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``--collision-approximation none`` ，可省略碰撞体属性。默认值为 ``convexDecomposition``"
" ，因此不传入此标志仍会创建碰撞几何。"

#: source/how-to/import_new_asset.rst:547
msgid "result of convert_mesh.py"
msgstr "转换 `convert_mesh.py` 的结果"
